# ============================================================ 25. FILE NAMING

Use deterministic names.

Pattern:

ox-dx-{category}-{name}-{variant}.{ext}

Examples:

ox-dx-symbol-structure.svg
ox-dx-symbol-observation.svg
ox-dx-pattern-resolution.svg
ox-dx-pattern-grid.svg
ox-dx-glyph-relation.svg
ox-dx-bg-graphite.webp

Never:

final2
new-final
latest
test123
really-final

# ============================================================ 26. QUALITY CONTROL

Validate:

SVG
PNG
WEBP
Markdown

For SVG:

valid XML
valid viewBox
no broken references
no external dependency
no unwanted raster embedding

For raster:

correct dimensions
correct crop
correct transparency
correct compression

For Markdown:

valid links
valid image paths
no broken references

